## NTL

Wyrm's Team Mode interoperates with the **NTL MOD for Slither.io** by
`[NTL] Nothing To Lose`. The tag artwork under `app/res/textures/wyrm_tags.png`
comes from that project's published tag set, and the 20 image arrows under
`app/res/textures/arrow_skins.png` come from NTL VANCED, OM Rajput's own fork of
that mod. The protocol notes in `ntl-team-protocol.md` and `ntl-tags.md`
describe NTL's own formats; the code that speaks them is Wyrm's own.

NTL tags are switched off in Wyrm for now. When they were on, custom tags were
authenticated by NTL's server against credentials the player held. Wyrm carried
those credentials and displayed what NTL returned; it did not issue tags, and it
could not grant one to somebody who had not been given the password for it.

